editor_description = "One FIGURE of an archers regiment's piece: the longbowman (tools/units3d/archer_parts/README.md), the infantry's rig contract with his own clips (MARCH, GARRISON aim, STANDBY, ATTACK shoot, DRAW, SPRINT, HIT, DODGE, DEATH) and the bow, quiver and arrow in the one skinned mesh. The 3D map (Map3DLayerUnits) stands instances of this scene in formation and plays its clips by order. Its material, shadow and look are edited HERE; the clips' loops are the .glb's import settings; its sizes are data/screens/map3d/army_art.csv."

